    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and your knees slightly bent. 2. Execution: Lower your torso until it is parallel to the ground, feeling a stretch in your hamstrings. 3. Control: Engage your glutes and hamstrings to return to the starting position.",
