    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Adjust the cable machine to a decline position. 2. Execution: Keeping a slight bend in your elbows, open your arms out to the sides in a controlled motion. 3. Control: Pause for a moment at the fully extended position, then slowly return to the starting position.",
