    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Attach a straight bar to a high pulley cable machine. 2. Execution: Pause for a moment at the bottom of the movement, squeezing your biceps. 3. Control: Inhale and slowly return the bar to the starting position, fully extending your arms.",
