    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Lie on a decline bench with your feet secured and your knees bent.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Place your hands behind your head or across your chest.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Engage your abs and lift your upper body off the bench, curling forward towards your knees.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your upper body back down to the starting position.\n\n5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
