    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Stand up straight with your feet shoulder-width apart and hold a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward. 2. Execution: Inhale and slowly lower the dumbbell back to the starting position. 3. Control: Repeat the movement with the opposite arm.",
