    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Lie flat on a bench with your head at one end and your feet firmly on the ground. 2. Execution: Keeping your arms straight, slowly lower the dumbbell behind your head in an arc motion. 3. Control: Pause for a moment at the bottom, then raise the dumbbell back to the starting position.",
    "summary_detailed_movement_pt": "1. Posição: Deite-se num banco com a cabeça numa extremidade e os pés firmemente apoiados no chão. 2. Execução: Mantendo os braços retos, desça lentamente o halter atrás da cabeça num movimento de arco. 3. Controle: Faça uma breve pausa na parte desça, depois levante o halter de volta à posição inicial.",
    "detailed_movement_es": "1. Posición inicial (Setup): Túmbate en un banco con la cabeza en un extremo y los pies firmemente apoyados en el suelo.\n\n2. Ejecución inicial: Sujeta una mancuerna con ambas manos y extiende los brazos rectos por encima del pecho.\n\n3. Fase principal y control: Manteniendo los brazos rectos, baja lentamente la mancuerna detrás de la cabeza en un movimiento de arco.\n\n4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa breve en la parte baja, luego levanta la mancuerna de vuelta a la posición inicial.\n\n5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.",
    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Lie flat on a bench with your head at one end and your feet firmly on the ground.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Hold a dumbbell with both hands and extend your arms straight above your chest.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your arms straight, slowly lower the dumbbell behind your head in an arc motion.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the bottom, then raise the dumbbell back to the starting position.\n\n5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
