    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Place a dumbbell on the ground in front of a bench.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Stand facing away from the bench with your feet shoulder-width apart.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Bend at the knees and hips to lower yourself down towards the bench, keeping your chest up and back straight.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Once your glutes touch the bench, push through your heels to stand back up to the starting position.\n\n5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
