    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Sit on an exercise ball with a dumbbell in one hand. 2. Execution: Slowly lower the dumbbell out to the side, keeping a slight bend in your elbow. Pause for a moment when your arm is parallel to the ground. 3. Control: Engage your chest muscles to bring the dumbbell back up to the starting position.",
