    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Sit on a bench with your back straight and feet flat on the ground. 2. Execution: Keeping your elbows bent, raise your arms out to the sides until they are parallel to the ground. 3. Control: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your arms back down to the starting position.",
