    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Lie on your side with your legs extended and your head supported by your arm. 2. Execution: Keeping your arm straight, raise the dumbbell up to shoulder height. 3. Control: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbell back down to the starting position.",
    "summary_detailed_movement_pt": "1. Posição: Deite-se de lado com as pernas estendidas e a cabeça apoiada sobre o braço. 2. Execução: Mantendo o braço reto, suba o halter até a altura do ombro. 3. Controle: Faça uma breve pausa na parte mais alta, depois desça lentamente o halter de volta à posição inicial.",
    "detailed_movement_es": "1. Posición inicial (Setup): Túmbate de lado con las piernas extendidas y la cabeza apoyada sobre el brazo.\n\n2. Ejecución inicial: Sujeta una mancuerna con la mano de arriba, con la palma hacia abajo.\n\n3. Fase principal y control: Manteniendo el brazo recto, sube la mancuerna hasta la altura del hombro.\n\n4. Retorno controlado: Haz una pausa breve en la parte más alta, luego baja lentamente la mancuerna de vuelta a la posición inicial.\n\n5. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado, luego cambia de lado.",
    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Lie on your side with your legs extended and your head supported by your arm.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Hold a dumbbell in your top hand with your palm facing down.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Keeping your arm straight, raise the dumbbell up to shoulder height.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbell back down to the starting position.\n\n5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions, then switch sides.",
