    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Sit on a bench with your back straight and feet flat on the ground. 2. Execution: Bend your elbows and lower the dumbbell behind your head, keeping your upper arms close to your ears. 3. Control: Extend your arms and raise the dumbbell back to the starting position.",
