    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and knees slightly bent. 2. Execution: Pull the ez barbell towards your lower chest, squeezing your shoulder blades together. 3. Control: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the ez barbell back to the starting position.",
