    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Adjust the sled machine to a comfortable weight.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Stand on the sled machine with your toes on the platform and your heels hanging off.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Hold onto the handles for stability.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Raise your heels as high as possible by pushing through the balls of your feet.\n\n5. Step 5: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your heels back down to the starting position.\n\n6. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
