    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Lie flat on your back with your knees bent and feet flat on the ground.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Place your hands by your sides, palms facing down.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Engage your core and glutes, then lift your hips off the ground until your body forms a straight line from your knees to your shoulders.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower your hips back down to the starting position.\n\n5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
