    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Adjust the seat height and position yourself facing the machine. 2. Execution: Pull the handle towards your body, keeping your elbow close to your side. Squeeze your back muscles at the top of the movement. 3. Control: Slowly release the handle back to the starting position.",
    "summary_detailed_movement_pt": "1. Posição: Ajuste a altura do assento e posicione-se frente à máquina. 2. Execução: Puxe do alça em direção ao corpo, mantendo o cotovelo perto do lateral. Contraia os músculos das costas no topo do movimento. 3. Controle: Solte lentamente a puxador de volta à posição inicial.",
    "detailed_movement_es": "1. Posición inicial (Setup): Ajusta la altura del asiento y colócate frente a la máquina.\n\n2. Ejecución inicial: Sujeta el asa con una mano y mantén la espalda recta.\n\n3. Fase principal y control: Tira del asa hacia el cuerpo, manteniendo el codo cerca del costado.\n\n4. Retorno controlado: Aprieta los músculos de la espalda en la parte superior del movimiento.\n\n5. Paso 5: Suelta lentamente la agarradera de vuelta a la posición inicial.\n\n6. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.",
    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Adjust the seat height and position yourself facing the machine.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Grasp the handle with one hand and keep your back straight.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Pull the handle towards your body, keeping your elbow close to your side.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Squeeze your back muscles at the top of the movement.\n\n5. Step 5: Slowly release the handle back to the starting position.\n\n6. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
