    "summary_detailed_movement_en": "1. Setup: Adjust the seat height and position yourself on the leverage machine. 2. Execution: Exhale and curl your forearms towards your upper arms, contracting your biceps. Pause for a moment at the top of the movement, squeezing your biceps. 3. Control: Inhale and slowly lower the handles back to the starting position.",
    "summary_detailed_movement_pt": "1. Posição: Ajuste a altura do assento e posicione-se na máquina de alavanca. 2. Execução: Faça uma breve pausa na parte mais alta do movimento, contraindo os bíceps. 3. Controle: Inspire e desça lentamente as alças de volta à posição inicial.",
    "detailed_movement_es": "1. Posición inicial (Setup): Ajusta la altura del asiento y colócate en la máquina de palanca.\n\n2. Ejecución inicial: Coloca los brazos superiores en la almohadilla y sujeta las asas con un agarre supino.\n\n3. Fase principal y control: Mantén la espalda recta y los codos colocados sobre la almohadilla.\n\n4. Retorno controlado: Exhala y flexiona los antebrazos hacia los brazos superiores, contrayendo los bíceps.\n\n5. Paso 5: Haz una pausa breve en la parte más alta del movimiento, contrayendo los bíceps.\n\n6. Paso 6: Inhala y baja lentamente las asas de vuelta a la posición inicial.\n\n7. Continuidad y repeticiones: Repite el número de repeticiones deseado.",
    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Adjust the seat height and position yourself on the leverage machine.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Place your upper arms on the pad and grip the handles with an underhand grip.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Keep your back straight and your elbows positioned on the pad.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Exhale and curl your forearms towards your upper arms, contracting your biceps.\n\n5. Step 5: Pause for a moment at the top of the movement, squeezing your biceps.\n\n6. Step 6: Inhale and slowly lower the handles back to the starting position.\n\n7. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
