    "detailed_movement_en": "1. Starting Setup: Start in a high plank position with your hands wider than shoulder-width apart.\n\n2. Initial Execution: Keep your body in a straight line from head to toe.\n\n3. Primary Phase & Control: Lower your chest towards the ground by bending your elbows, keeping them close to your sides.\n\n4. Controlled Return: Push through your palms to extend your arms and return to the starting position.\n\n5. Continuity & Repetitions: Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.",
